            "action_name": {
              "value": "Gnaw"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The owlbear attempts to disembowel the creature with a beak Strike. If the Strike hits, the target must attempt a DC 22 Will save.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target is sickened 1.\nFailure: The target is sickened 1 and slowed 1 as long as it remains sickened."
            },
